```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant src as Ambient source
    participant cutter as Session cutter
    participant buf as Local buffer
    participant net as Enqueue client
    participant dp as dpkms /api/v1

    src->>cutter: OnEvent(t=10:00, bundle=zoom)
    cutter->>cutter: _start_locked → sess_abc
    cutter->>buf: append SessionOpened(sess_abc, 10:00)
    src->>buf: append RawEvent(t=10:01, session_id=sess_abc)
    src->>buf: append RawEvent(t=10:02, session_id=sess_abc)

    Note over net,dp: dpkms unreachable<br/>(network partition)
    net-->>net: emit .waiting
    net-->>net: backoff 1s, 2s, 4s ...

    Note over net,dp: dpkms returns
    net->>dp: POST /api/v1/analyze (event @ 10:01)
    dp-->>dp: object created with session_id=sess_abc<br/>(soft-FK; session row not yet present)
    net->>dp: POST /api/v1/analyze (event @ 10:02)
    net->>dp: PUT /api/v1/sessions/sess_abc (idempotent)
    dp-->>dp: session row inserted<br/>existing objects already linked

    Note over cutter,dp: 10:30 — idle gap > 5min
    cutter->>buf: append SessionClosed(sess_abc, 10:25, reason=idle)
    net->>dp: PUT /api/v1/sessions/sess_abc (now with ended_at)
    dp-->>net: 200 OK
```
